{"html":"<p>This is Rust's strongest claim: the places where a memory bug is a security\nincident, and a garbage-collection pause is an outage.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-the-domain-demands\">What the domain demands</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Requirement</th>\n<th>Why it decides the language</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>No GC pauses</td>\n<td>A 50 ms pause in a proxy is a timeout for 10,000 clients</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Predictable memory</td>\n<td>Container limits are hard; RSS must be flat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Safety without a runtime</td>\n<td>The kernel cannot trust a GC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Small binaries</td>\n<td>Boot time and cold-start cost scale with image size</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Multithreaded by default</td>\n<td>One core per request is not affordable</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Rust hits all five at once. That is unusual — C++ hits the first four and loses\nthe fifth (safety), Go hits the last two and loses the first.</p>\n<h2 id=\"who-runs-it-and-what-they-replaced\">Who runs it, and what they replaced</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>System</th>\n<th>What Rust replaced</th>\n<th>Why</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>AWS Firecracker</strong></td>\n<td>full VMs / containers for Lambda and Fargate</td>\n<td>microVMs boot in ~125 ms with ~5 MB overhead; written in Rust for the isolation guarantees</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Cloudflare Pingora</strong></td>\n<td>NGINX for their edge proxy</td>\n<td>memory safety plus a threading model that survives hundreds of thousands of connections per process; Cloudflare reported serving over a trillion requests a day on it</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Discord \"Read States\"</strong></td>\n<td>a Go service</td>\n<td>Go's GC caused tail-latency spikes at their read volume; the Rust rewrite removed the pauses</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Dropbox \"Nucleus\"</strong></td>\n<td>their old sync engine</td>\n<td>a rewrite that had to be correct under partial failure on millions of machines</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Linux kernel</strong></td>\n<td>C, for new drivers</td>\n<td>Rust support landed in 6.1; GPU drivers for Apple silicon are the most visible in-tree users</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Android</strong></td>\n<td>C/C++ in new code</td>\n<td>Google reported memory-safety vulnerabilities falling sharply as the share of new Rust code rose</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>The pattern: nobody rewrites everything. They rewrite the <strong>hot, dangerous\ncomponent</strong> and leave the rest.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-shape-of-the-code\">The shape of the code</h2>\n<p>A proxy's core loop, in the form Cloudflare describes it: accept, route, forward,\nwith no allocation on the request path.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">use</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">sync</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Arc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">use</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> tokio</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">net</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">{</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">TcpListener</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">TcpStream</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">};</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> async</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> fn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> serve</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(listener</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> TcpListener</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, upstreams</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> Arc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Vec</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">String</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">>>) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">io</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Result</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    loop</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">        let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> (client, peer) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> listener</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">accept</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">()</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.await?</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">        let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> upstreams </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> Arc</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">clone</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">upstreams);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">        // one task per connection, no thread per connection</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">        tokio</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">spawn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">async</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> move</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">            if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> Err</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(e) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> handle</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(client, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">upstreams, peer)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.await</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">                tracing</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">debug!</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">%</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">peer, error </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> %</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">e, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#96D0FF\">\"connection closed\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">            }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">        });</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    }</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">async</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> fn</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> handle</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    mut</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> client</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> TcpStream</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    upstreams</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">String</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">],</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">    _peer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">net</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">SocketAddr</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">,</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">-></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> std</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">io</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Result</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">&#x3C;()> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">    // pick an upstream without allocating; health state lives in an atomic</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> idx </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> fastrand</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">usize</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">..</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">upstreams</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">len</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">());</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    let</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> mut</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> upstream </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> TcpStream</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">connect</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">upstreams[idx])</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.await?</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">    tokio</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">io</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\">copy_bidirectional</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">&#x26;mut</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> client, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">&#x26;mut</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> upstream)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">.await?</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">;</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">    Ok</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(())</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">}</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>Three things to notice, because they are why this is fast:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>spawn</code> per connection</strong>, not per thread. 100k connections = 100k futures on a\nhandful of threads.</li>\n<li><strong><code>copy_bidirectional</code></strong> uses a fixed buffer and moves bytes without parsing\nthem. Parsing every byte is how proxies get slow.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Arc&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;String>></code></strong>, cloned once per connection. A <code>String</code> per request would\nallocate on the hot path.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"what-to-steal-for-your-own-service\">What to steal for your own service</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Flat memory is a feature you can sell.</strong> No GC means <code>memory.limit</code> in\nKubernetes is a real ceiling, not a suggestion.</li>\n<li><strong>Start with the hot path, not the whole service.</strong> Rewrite one endpoint, ship\nit, measure. Firecracker started as a VMM, not an operating system.</li>\n<li><strong>Instrument the tail, not the mean.</strong> p99 is where Rust's advantage shows up,\nand where the business case lives.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"where-rust-is-the-wrong-answer\">Where Rust is the wrong answer</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A control plane that runs a few hundred requests a minute: use Go or Python.</li>\n<li>Anything where the team's velocity matters more than the last 20% of latency.</li>\n<li>Glue code between managed services — the network dominates, not the CPU.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"try-it\">Try it</h2>\n<p>Take any Rust HTTP service you have built and put it behind a load test with a\n50 ms upstream. Watch p99 stay flat while a GC'd equivalent spikes. That\nmeasurement is the entire argument.</p>\n<p><strong>Next:</strong> <a href=\"02-developer-tools.md\">Developer tools</a></p>"}